    <string name="step_capture">2. Sentence and screenshot</string>
    <string name="step_capture_why">With the accessibility service on, the app keeps the last text you select in another app and takes a screenshot at that moment. The card then gets the sentence around the word and the picture. Without the service, the sentence is the text you selected, and there is no picture.</string>
